# Leave empty in development: Vite proxies /runs, /agents, /tools, /config,
# /concepts and /health to http://127.0.0.1:8000 (see vite.config.ts).
VITE_API_URL=

# On Vercel or behind Cloudflare Access, point this at your backend origin, e.g.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# When running behind Cloudflare Access on a separate domain, optional logout URL:
# VITE_CLOUDFLARE_LOGOUT_URL=https://myteam.cloudflareaccess.com/cdn-cgi/access/logout
